This repository contains two things under two different licenses:

1. The C23 rendering, terminal-handling, and build code, which is original
   to this project.
2. The train ASCII art and animation behaviour, ported from Masashi
   Toyoda's original `sl` (https://github.com/mtoyoda/sl), by way of an
   intermediate Rust port (https://github.com/jesper-olsen/sl) by the same
   author as this repository.

